<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brahma raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brahma raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lazard Freres &amp; Co said it upgraded Brazilian brewery Companhia Cervejaria Brahma SA to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- a Lazard Freres report said: &quot;Despite a slowdown in Brazilian consumption this year, we expect Brahma to continue to report strong gains in cash flow on the back of improving efficiency and incremental additions to its already leading market share.&quot;</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $20 on Brahma's ADRs, which closed Wednesday at 15-3/16.</p>
</text>
